Source: hermes-kms
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: MrOz59 <https://github.com/MrOz59>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-dkms
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/MrOz59/Hermes-KMS
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: hermes-kms-dkms
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms, acl, kmod
Recommends: build-essential, linux-headers-generic
Description: Hermes-KMS virtual DRM/KMS capture driver (DKMS source)
 Virtual display driver and public UAPI with DKMS integration, host access
 policy and capture utilities. Builds for the installed kernel with matching
 headers. The host connector is initially disabled until owned by a client.

Package: hermes-kms-seatd
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hermes-kms-dkms (= ${binary:Version}), seatd
Suggests: polkitd
Description: Optional private seat broker for Hermes-KMS isolated sessions
 Creates private seatd instances for isolated DRM/KMS sessions. This package
 depends on the matching Hermes-KMS DKMS source package and is not needed
 for ordinary single-display capture.
